# Committed on purpose — Vite loads this for `vite build` (production mode), so
# packaged/CI builds get the REAL Clerk sign-in with zero extra setup. The
# publishable key is public by design (it ships in the renderer bundle of a
# publicly downloadable installer either way; see .env.example). Secrets do NOT
# belong here — the delivery token stays a CI secret baked in by build.mjs.
#
# NOTE: this is the DEV Clerk instance (pk_test). Before distributing outside
# the team, switch to the production instance's pk_live and allowlist the
# desktop's loopback origin (http://127.0.0.1:43117) in Clerk.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_YW11c2luZy1lbGstMzQuY2xlcmsuYWNjb3VudHMuZGV2JA
